<title>USA: Dow Corning Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dow Corning Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIDLAND, Mich. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net		     $ 61,400		 $ 39,600</p>
<p> Revs		     639,600		  615,000</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Net		    $ 221,700		$ 190,600</p>
<p> Revs		   2,530,000		2,490,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 net includes one-time pre-tax gain of $9.5 million from sale of Bisco Products unit.</p>
<p>1995 year net includes Q2 after-tax charge of $221.2 million from change in accounting for global settlement of breast implant lawsuits.</p>
<p>Joint venture of Dow Chemical Co and Corning Inc.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
